# What must never reach a public host.
#
# leveranser/ is the product. The AI Career Kit is 299 kr; publishing the folder
# hands it to anyone who guesses the URL. This line is the only thing standing
# between `vercel deploy` and giving it away.
leveranser/

# The case queue and its door. The API cannot run on Vercel anyway — it keeps
# its data in a SQLite file, which a serverless host discards between deploys —
# and there is no reason to advertise that an admin page exists.
server/
admin.html
assets/js/admin.js

# Not part of the site.
tests/
tools/
docs/
node_modules/
*.bundle
CLAUDE.md
SECURITY.md
